#: ipaserver/plugins/hbacsvc.py:28
msgid ""
"\n"
"HBAC Services\n"
"\n"
"The PAM services that HBAC can control access to. The name used here\n"
"must match the service name that PAM is evaluating.\n"
"\n"
"EXAMPLES:\n"
"\n"
" Add a new HBAC service:\n"
"   ipa hbacsvc-add tftp\n"
"\n"
" Modify an existing HBAC service:\n"
"   ipa hbacsvc-mod --desc=\"TFTP service\" tftp\n"
"\n"
" Search for HBAC services. This example will return two results, the FTP\n"
" service and the newly-added tftp service:\n"
"   ipa hbacsvc-find ftp\n"
"\n"
" Delete an HBAC service:\n"
"   ipa hbacsvc-del tftp\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"HBAC pakalpojumi\n"
"\n"
"PAM pakalpojumi, kuriem HBAC var kontrolēt piekļuvi. Šeit izmantotajam\n"
"nosaukumam jāatbilst pakalpojuma nosaukumam, ko novērtē PAM.\n"
"\n"
"PIEMĒRI:\n"
"\n"
" Pievienot jaunu HBAC pakalpojumu:\n"
"   ipa hbacsvc-add tftp\n"
"\n"
" Mainīt esošu HBAC pakalpojumu:\n"
"   ipa hbacsvc-mod --desc=\"TFTP service\" tftp\n"
"\n"
" Meklēt HBAC pakalpojumus. Šis piemērs atgriezīs divus rezultātus — FTP\n"
" pakalpojumu un tikko pievienoto tftp pakalpojumu:\n"
"   ipa hbacsvc-find ftp\n"
"\n"
" Dzēst HBAC pakalpojumu:\n"
"   ipa hbacsvc-del tftp\n"
"\n"

#: ipaserver/plugins/hbacsvc.py:61 ipaserver/plugins/hbacsvc.py:102
