#: ipaserver/plugins/whoami.py:15
msgid ""
"\n"
"Return information about currently authenticated identity\n"
"\n"
"Who am I command returns information on how to get\n"
"more details about the identity authenticated for this\n"
"request. The information includes:\n"
"\n"
" * type of object\n"
" * command to retrieve details of the object\n"
" * arguments and options to pass to the command\n"
"\n"
"The information is returned as a dictionary. Examples below use\n"
"'key: value' output for illustrative purposes.\n"
"\n"
"EXAMPLES:\n"
"\n"
" Look up as IPA user:\n"
"   kinit admin\n"
"   ipa console\n"
"   >> api.Command.whoami()\n"
"   ------------------------------------------\n"
"   object: user\n"
"   command: user_show/1\n"
"   arguments: admin\n"
"   ------------------------------------------\n"
"\n"
" Look up as a user from a trusted domain:\n"
"   kinit user@AD.DOMAIN\n"
"   ipa console\n"
"   >> api.Command.whoami()\n"
"   ------------------------------------------\n"
"   object: idoverrideuser\n"
"   command: idoverrideuser_show/1\n"
"   arguments: ('default trust view', 'user@ad.domain')\n"
"   ------------------------------------------\n"
"\n"
" Look up as a host:\n"
"   kinit -k\n"
"   ipa console\n"
"   >> api.Command.whoami()\n"
"   ------------------------------------------\n"
"   object: host\n"
"   command: host_show/1\n"
"   arguments: ipa.example.com\n"
"   ------------------------------------------\n"
"\n"
" Look up as a Kerberos service:\n"
"   kinit -k -t /path/to/keytab HTTP/ipa.example.com\n"
"   ipa console\n"
"   >> api.Command.whoami()\n"
"   ------------------------------------------\n"
"   object: service\n"
"   command: service_show/1\n"
"   arguments: HTTP/ipa.example.com\n"
"   ------------------------------------------\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Atgriezt informāciju par pašlaik autentificēto identitāti\n"
"\n"
"Komanda „who am I” atgriež informāciju par to, kā iegūt\n"
"sīkāku informāciju par šim pieprasījumam autentificēto\n"
"identitāti. Informācija ietver:\n"
"\n"
" * objekta tipu\n"
" * komandu objekta informācijas izgūšanai\n"
" * komandai nododamos argumentus un opcijas\n"
"\n"
"Informācija tiek atgriezta kā vārdnīca. Turpmākie piemēri ilustrācijai\n"
"izmanto izvadi 'key: value'.\n"
"\n"
"PIEMĒRI:\n"
"\n"
" Uzmeklēt kā IPA lietotājam:\n"
"   kinit admin\n"
"   ipa console\n"
"   >> api.Command.whoami()\n"
"   ------------------------------------------\n"
"   object: user\n"
"   command: user_show/1\n"
"   arguments: admin\n"
"   ------------------------------------------\n"
"\n"
" Uzmeklēt kā lietotājam no uzticama domēna:\n"
"   kinit user@AD.DOMAIN\n"
"   ipa console\n"
"   >> api.Command.whoami()\n"
"   ------------------------------------------\n"
"   object: idoverrideuser\n"
"   command: idoverrideuser_show/1\n"
"   arguments: ('default trust view', 'user@ad.domain')\n"
"   ------------------------------------------\n"
"\n"
" Uzmeklēt kā resursdatoram:\n"
"   kinit -k\n"
"   ipa console\n"
"   >> api.Command.whoami()\n"
"   ------------------------------------------\n"
"   object: host\n"
"   command: host_show/1\n"
"   arguments: ipa.example.com\n"
"   ------------------------------------------\n"
"\n"
" Uzmeklēt kā Kerberos pakalpojumam:\n"
"   kinit -k -t /path/to/keytab HTTP/ipa.example.com\n"
"   ipa console\n"
"   >> api.Command.whoami()\n"
"   ------------------------------------------\n"
"   object: service\n"
"   command: service_show/1\n"
"   arguments: HTTP/ipa.example.com\n"
"   ------------------------------------------\n"

