#: ipaserver/plugins/vault.py:53
msgid ""
"\n"
"Vaults\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Glabātavas\n"

#: ipaserver/plugins/vault.py:55
msgid ""
"\n"
"Manage vaults.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Pārvaldīt glabātavas.\n"

#: ipaserver/plugins/vault.py:57
msgid ""
"\n"
"Vault is a secure place to store a secret. One vault can only\n"
"store one secret. When archiving a secret in a vault, the\n"
"existing secret (if any) is overwritten.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Glabātava ir droša vieta noslēpuma glabāšanai. Viena glabātava var\n"
"glabāt tikai vienu noslēpumu. Arhivējot noslēpumu glabātavā,\n"
"esošais noslēpums (ja tāds ir) tiek pārrakstīts.\n"

#: ipaserver/plugins/vault.py:61
msgid ""
"\n"
"Based on the ownership there are three vault categories:\n"
"* user/private vault\n"
"* service vault\n"
"* shared vault\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Pēc piederības ir trīs glabātavu kategorijas:\n"
"* lietotāja/privātā glabātava\n"
"* pakalpojuma glabātava\n"
"* koplietojama glabātava\n"

#: ipaserver/plugins/vault.py:66
msgid ""
"\n"
"User vaults are vaults owned used by a particular user. Private\n"
"vaults are vaults owned the current user. Service vaults are\n"
"vaults owned by a service. Shared vaults are owned by the admin\n"
"but they can be used by other users or services.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Lietotāja glabātavas ir glabātavas, kas pieder konkrētam lietotājam un tiek "
"viņa izmantotas. Privātās\n"
"glabātavas ir pašreizējam lietotājam piederošas glabātavas. Pakalpojuma "
"glabātavas ir\n"
"pakalpojumam piederošas glabātavas. Koplietojamās glabātavas pieder "
"administratoram,\n"
"bet tās var izmantot citi lietotāji vai pakalpojumi.\n"

#: ipaserver/plugins/vault.py:71
msgid ""
"\n"
"Based on the security mechanism there are three types of\n"
"vaults:\n"
"* standard vault\n"
"* symmetric vault\n"
"* asymmetric vault\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Pēc drošības mehānisma ir trīs glabātavu\n"
"tipi:\n"
"* standarta glabātava\n"
"* simetriskā glabātava\n"
"* asimetriskā glabātava\n"

#: ipaserver/plugins/vault.py:77
msgid ""
"\n"
"Standard vault uses a secure mechanism to transport and\n"
"store the secret. The secret can only be retrieved by users\n"
"that have access to the vault.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Standarta glabātava izmanto drošu mehānismu noslēpuma transportēšanai un\n"
"glabāšanai. Noslēpumu var izgūt tikai lietotāji,\n"
"kam ir piekļuve glabātavai.\n"

#: ipaserver/plugins/vault.py:81
msgid ""
"\n"
"Symmetric vault is similar to the standard vault, but it\n"
"pre-encrypts the secret using a password before transport.\n"
"The secret can only be retrieved using the same password.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Simetriskā glabātava ir līdzīga standarta glabātavai, bet tā\n"
"pirms transportēšanas iepriekš šifrē noslēpumu ar paroli.\n"
"Noslēpumu var izgūt tikai ar to pašu paroli.\n"

#: ipaserver/plugins/vault.py:85
msgid ""
"\n"
"Asymmetric vault is similar to the standard vault, but it\n"
"pre-encrypts the secret using a public key before transport.\n"
"The secret can only be retrieved using the private key.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Asimetriskā glabātava ir līdzīga standarta glabātavai, bet tā\n"
"pirms transportēšanas iepriekš šifrē noslēpumu ar publisko atslēgu.\n"
"Noslēpumu var izgūt tikai ar privāto atslēgu.\n"

