"No DNSSEC key master is installed. DNSSEC zone signing will not work until "
"the DNSSEC key master is installed."
msgstr ""
"Nav instalēts DNSSEC atslēgu galvenais serveris. DNSSEC zonu parakstīšana "
"nedarbosies, kamēr DNSSEC atslēgu galvenais serveris nav instalēts."

